      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}[(x^2-7)-(x^2-10)][(x^2-7)+(x^2-10)]&=3\\\\3(2x^2-17)&=3\\\\2x^2-17&=1\\\\2x^2&=18\\\\x^2&=9\\\\x&=\\pm3\\end{align*}$$",
